.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE ANNOUNCEMENT DRAFT DISCARD"
.SH NAME
hamstik release announcement draft discard \- Discard the active announcement draft
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release announcement draft discard [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Discard the active announcement draft
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --revision
Draft revision to discard (defaults to the current draft's)
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
